Muni hosts gather around Rama at Sharabhanga --- Ascetics praise Rama as Ikshvaku lord like Indra --- Ascetics cite sixth-share king must protect subjects --- Ascetics show bodies of rakshasa-slain sages --- Ascetics report slaughter near Pampa Mandakini Chitrakuta --- Ascetics beg refuge and protection from night-roamers --- Rama vows forest stay will slay ascetics foes --- Rama pledges boon and marches to Sutikshna